<div id="readability-page-1" class="page"><div role="main" id="main" tabindex="-1"><section data-section-name="hero" data-component-name="hero" data-viewable-component="true" data-mode="dark" data-component-extra-variant="redesign-2024"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/7ecd57f2fa3d7b997d29181a62c954ee.png?originalWidth=1920&amp;originalHeight=1080&amp;width=828" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/7ecd57f2fa3d7b997d29181a62c954ee.png?originalWidth=1920&amp;originalHeight=1080&amp;width=480 480w, https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/7ecd57f2fa3d7b997d29181a62c954ee.png?originalWidth=1920&amp;originalHeight=1080&amp;width=828 828w, https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/7ecd57f2fa3d7b997d29181a62c954ee.png?originalWidth=1920&amp;originalHeight=1080&amp;width=1440 1440w" sizes="100vw" width="1920" height="1080" alt="" loading="eager" decoding="sync"></section><div data-section-name="a-b" data-component-name="home-ab-section" data-viewable-component="true" data-mode="dark"><p><span data-group-index="0" tabindex="0" id="ab-section-tab-0" aria-controls="ab-section-content-0" aria-selected="true" role="tab">Sell everywhere people shop.</span><span data-group-index="1" tabindex="-1" id="ab-section-tab-1" aria-controls="ab-section-content-1" aria-selected="false" role="tab"> Online and in person.</span><span data-group-index="2" tabindex="-1" id="ab-section-tab-2" aria-controls="ab-section-content-2" aria-selected="false" role="tab"> Across AI and on social.</span><span data-group-index="3" tabindex="-1" id="ab-section-tab-3" aria-controls="ab-section-content-3" aria-selected="false" role="tab"> Locally and globally.</span></p></div><div data-section-name="local-and-global" data-component-name="data-localglobal-section" data-viewable-component="true" data-mode="dark"><p></p><h3>Grow around the&nbsp;world</h3><p></p></div><div data-section-name="for-everyone" data-component-name="home-foreveryone-section" data-viewable-component="true" data-mode="dark"><p></p><h3>For anyone from entrepreneurs to enterprise</h3><p></p></div><div data-section-name="sidekick" data-component-name="home-sidekick-section" data-viewable-component="true" data-mode="dark"><p></p><h2>Meet your secret weapon,&nbsp;Sidekick</h2><p></p></div><div data-section-name="apps" data-component-name="home-apps-section" data-viewable-component="true" data-mode="dark"><h3>Customize everything with&nbsp;apps</h3><p>The Shopify App Store has <a data-component-name="cta-app-store" href="https://apps.shopify.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer">21,000+ commerce apps</a> for whatever specialized features your business might need.</p></div><div data-section-name="no-better-place" data-component-name="home-heading-section" data-viewable-component="true" data-mode="dark"><p></p><h2>There’s no better place for you to&nbsp;build</h2><p></p></div><div data-section-name="checkout-stats" data-component-name="home-stats-section" data-viewable-component="true" data-mode="dark"><p></p><h3>The world’s best-converting&nbsp;checkout</h3><p></p><ul><li><div><picture data-component-name="image"><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/94bf4a2851a16821c472f9e9cf1b5bb7.svg"></picture><p>Higher conversions</p></div><div dir="ltr"><p dir="auto">15</p><p>%</p></div></li><li><div><picture data-component-name="image"><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/67583e03fbb03b2f502951e163150c8f.svg"></picture><p>High-intent shoppers</p></div><div dir="ltr"><p dir="auto">250M</p><p>+</p></div></li></ul><p><a data-component-name="cta-checkout" href="https://www.shopify.com/uk/checkout">Shopify Checkout</a> with <a data-component-name="cta-shop-pay" href="https://www.shopify.com/uk/shop-pay">Shop Pay</a> converts up to 50% higher than guest checkout and exposes your brand to hundreds of millions of buyers.</p><p>Based on external study with a Big Three global consulting firm in April, 2023.</p></div><div data-section-name="rock-steady" data-component-name="home-rocksteady-section" data-viewable-component="true" data-mode="dark"><h3>Rock steady. Blazing&nbsp;fast.</h3><p>Your Shopify store runs strong, even during your most epic product drops.</p></div><div data-section-name="capital" data-component-name="home-capital-section" data-viewable-component="true" data-mode="dark"><div><blockquote>Shopify Capital has given us the funding we need to stock up on inventory and grow rapidly.</blockquote></div><div><div><h3>Shopify is here to&nbsp;help</h3><p>If your business needs a boost, <a data-component-name="cta-lending" href="https://www.shopify.com/uk/capital">Shopify Capital</a> is here to lend a hand.</p></div><div><div><p>$5B US loaned out so&nbsp;far</p><p>Invested in Shopify merchants</p></div><div><p>Funding up to $2M&nbsp;US</p><p>Amounts tailored to meet your needs</p></div><div><p>0%&nbsp;equity</p><p>No stakes taken—ever</p></div></div></div></div><div data-section-name="conversion" data-component-name="home-conversion-section" data-viewable-component="true" data-mode="dark"><p></p><h2 id="conversion-heading">Build fast on&nbsp;Shopify</h2><p></p><div role="list" aria-labelledby="conversion-heading"><p role="listitem" tabindex="0"><span>01</span><span>Add your first product</span></p><p role="listitem" tabindex="0"><span>02</span><span>Customize your store</span></p><p role="listitem" tabindex="0"><span>03</span><span>Set up payments</span></p></div></div></div></div>